      {
        "text": "On this show and all of our shows, we affirm that the Black woman is as close to God as possible on this planet.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "When we say Black women come to the rescue and wear the capes, we mean it seriously.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "This affirmation has been consistent throughout our time in this space.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Longtime listeners already understand this truth.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Some people are new to the show or newly engaged in politics.",
        "confidence": 0.87
